stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NEW : watcher inserts (unique key)
  NEW --> ACTING : dispatcher claims it
  ACTING --> DONE : no automation matched, or all ran / cooled down
  ACTING --> FAILED : an automation run failed
  ACTING --> AWAITING_CONFIRM : an automation places orders for a LIVE budget
  AWAITING_CONFIRM --> ACTING : confirm or decline on the phone, or expiry
  ACTING --> DECLINED : you declined
  ACTING --> EXPIRED : not confirmed within confirmWithinMinutes
  DONE --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*]
  DECLINED --> [*]
  EXPIRED --> [*]

  note right of ACTING
    Per matching automation the event keeps an outcome:
    run status (SUCCEEDED, PARTIAL, FAILED, SKIPPED) or
    COOLDOWN, AWAITING_CONFIRM, DECLINED, EXPIRED.
    ACTING is also what stops a second confirm tap.
  end note
